    "emailSubject": "ShareIt - Support",
    "faqQ1": "What is ShareIt?",
    "faqA1": "ShareIt is an app for exchanging goods and services between users. You can find items or offer your own, chat with other users and complete deals with ratings.",
    "faqQ2": "How do I create a listing?",
    "faqA2": "Tap the \"+\" button at the bottom of the app, choose whether you're offering or seeking, fill in the details (title, description, photo, location) and tap \"Publish\".",
    "faqQ3": "How do deals work?",
    "faqA3": "When you agree with a user, you send a deal proposal with an expiry date. Once accepted, the deal becomes active. On expiry, both sides must submit a rating for it to be completed.",
    "faqQ4": "How do I make my profile private?",
    "faqA4": "In Settings, under the \"App\" section, find the \"Private profile\" option and enable it. Only your friends will be able to see your wall.",
    "faqQ5": "How do I block a user?",
    "faqA5": "Go to the user's profile, tap the 3 dots at the top right and choose \"Block\". You can unblock from Settings → Blocked users.",
    "faqQ6": "How do I delete my account?",
    "faqA6": "Go to Settings → Delete account. Note: it's not allowed if you have active deals or deals without completed ratings. Deletion is permanent.",
    "faqQ7": "Why does it ask for phone verification?",
    "faqA7": "Phone verification protects the community from spam and fake accounts. Each phone number can be linked to only one account.",
    "faqQ8": "How do I report inappropriate content?",
    "faqA8": "Every listing or profile has a report button (3 dots). Our team reviews every report within 24 hours.",
    "faqQ9": "I'm not receiving notifications, what do I do?",
    "faqA9": "Check in your phone's Settings that notifications are enabled for ShareIt. Also try logging out and back in to the app.",
    "faqQ10": "Is the app free?",
    "faqA10": "Yes, ShareIt is completely free. We don't charge any commission for deals between users."
  },
